---
title: GigWerk — architecture as I understand it, with the two gaps marked
---
flowchart TB

    subgraph HUMAN["HUMAN"]
        Q["review queue<br/><i>approve · refuse</i><br/><b>not in your list</b>"]
    end

    subgraph HARNESS["HARNESS — authoring and learning"]
        direction TB

        AI["AI<br/><i>the only model in the system</i>"]
        LOOP["agentic loop<br/>+ standard tools"]
        DESIGN["actor design<br/>and review tools"]
        SKILLS["agent skills module<br/><i>HOW to compose</i>"]
        PLUGINS["plugins module<br/><i>WHAT can be claimed</i>"]
        GATE["GATE — Elpi<br/><i>book / queue / refuse</i><br/><b>not in your list</b>"]
        FEEDBACK["actor feedback module<br/><i>prediction vs outcome</i>"]
        ALEPH["aleph / learning module"]
        DB[("SQLite store<br/>components · ledger<br/>verdicts · crash facts")]
    end

    subgraph RUNTIME["ACTOR RUNTIME — inside or beside? ← the question"]
        direction TB
        BOOK["booker<br/><i>the agent that books gigs</i>"]
        DELIVERY["delivery system<br/><i>writes c_inbox</i>"]
        STEP["step system<br/><i>writes c_state</i>"]
        LABOR["labor pool<br/><i>in-process / subprocess<br/>by provenance</i>"]
        CRITIC["critics<br/><i>deterministic checks</i>"]
    end

    SKILLS --> AI
    AI --> LOOP
    LOOP --> DESIGN
    DESIGN -->|proposal| GATE

    PLUGINS -->|"seeds capability table<br/>only path to a new tool"| DB

    GATE -->|book| DB
    GATE -->|refuse<br/>logged as negative set| DB
    GATE -->|"queue<br/>requires_booking"| Q
    Q -->|approved| DB

    DB -->|composition| BOOK
    BOOK --> DELIVERY
    DELIVERY --> STEP
    STEP --> LABOR
    LABOR --> CRITIC

    LABOR -->|outcome| FEEDBACK
    CRITIC -->|verdict| FEEDBACK
    FEEDBACK --> DB

    DB --> ALEPH
    ALEPH -->|"induced rules<br/>never auto-applied"| Q
    Q -->|"reviewed rules"| GATE

    classDef gap fill:#3b1f1f,stroke:#e06c75,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 4,color:#f0f0f0
    classDef model fill:#1f2d3b,stroke:#61afef,stroke-width:2px,color:#f0f0f0
    classDef store fill:#1f3b2d,stroke:#98c379,stroke-width:2px,color:#f0f0f0
    classDef frozen fill:#2d2333,stroke:#c678dd,stroke-width:2px,color:#f0f0f0

    class GATE,Q gap
    class AI model
    class DB store
    class PLUGINS,CRITIC frozen
